   "output": "You are comparing two drafts written from the same brief. Read no other file, and do not run commands or browse; judge only the text below.\n\nBrief: Write the landing page copy for `sackview`, following the tool page section order.\n\n<<<DRAFT A\n# See inside a ZIP archive before unpacking it\n\nsackview shows what is inside a ZIP archive before you unpack it. Use the total unpacked size to check available disk space before extracting elsewhere.\n\n```sh\npipx install sackview\n```\n\nEach entry shows its name, compressed size, and unpacked size.\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip\n```\n\nThis command lists the archive\u2019s entries.\n\n## Commands\n\nShow the ten entries with the largest unpacked sizes, largest first:\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip --largest 10\n```\n\nShow only entries whose names match a pattern:\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip --find '*.csv'\n```\n\n## Good to know\n\n### Archive safety\n\nsackview never extracts entries or changes the archive.\n\n### Offline inspection\n\nInspection works offline and sends no archive contents to a service.\n\n### Supported formats\n\nsackview supports ZIP archives only. Other archive formats produce an unsupported-format message.\nDRAFT A>>>\n\n<<<DRAFT B\n# Inspect ZIP archives before you unpack them\n\nsackview shows each entry\u2019s name, compressed size, and unpacked size.\n\n```sh\npipx install sackview\n```\n\nZIP archives only \u00b7 Offline inspection \u00b7 No extraction\n\n## Capture\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip\n```\n\nLists the archive\u2019s entries.\n\n## Commands\n\n| Command | What it shows |\n| --- | --- |\n| `sackview inspect photos.zip` | All entries in the archive. |\n| `sackview inspect photos.zip --largest 10` | The ten entries with the largest unpacked sizes, largest first. |\n| `sackview inspect photos.zip --find '*.csv'` | Only entries whose names match the pattern. |\n\n## Keys\n\nNo key bindings are specified.\n\n## Check disk space\n\nsackview displays the total unpacked size. Use it to check available disk space before extracting the archive elsewhere.\n\n## Good to know\n\n**Archive safety**  \nsackview never extracts entries or changes the archive.\n\n**Privacy**  \nInspection sends no archive contents to a service.\n\n**Unsupported formats**  \nOther archive formats produce an unsupported-format message and exit code `24`.\nDRAFT B>>>\n\nAnswer each question with \"A\", \"B\", or \"SAME\":\n- \"reader\": Could a first-time reader do what they came to do?\n- \"careful\": Does it read like a careful person wrote it?\n- \"overall\": Which draft is better overall?\n\nReply with only JSON: {\"reader\": \"A\", \"careful\": \"A\", \"overall\": \"A\", \"reason\": \"<one sentence>\"}",
